    "fabricated": "right",
    "why": "Right's OCR contains nothing but the syllable म repeated for 16,700 characters, yet its output supplies Brihadaranyaka Upanishad 4.4.7-10 in full with Devanagari text, transliteration and word-by-word glosses that exist nowhere in that source, while left renders its own legible verses accurately line for line."
   },
   {
