    "fabricated": "none",
    "why": "both render every contents line present in their own OCR including riddles, the Leo the Wise oracle, Gennadius, the Franks piece, Cyril and Euthymius, each keeping its own editor reading Harles vs Hoeschel without inventing entries."
   },
   {
